  "note": "The brief files unrelated spellings such as אָבִי “my father”, נָבִיא “prophet”, and בָּנוּ “in us” under the verb; these are not senses of בוא. Redirect keys b.ab.ad, m.ai.ae, m.as.af and w.ae.ag add no separate word. The source lemma בִּאָה is displayed here with its full dictionary spelling בִּיאָה. No Peshitta cognate was found; its ordinary verbs אתא and עלל belong to other root entries."
